id: RS-SEC-031
ilities: [integrity]
source: cpm
maturity: 3
action: warn
title: Regex from user input
category: security
severity: warning
engine: pattern
target:
  extensions: .rs
  exclude_paths: test/ tests/ vendor/ target/ .git/
  content_contains: Regex::new
patterns:
  - regex: Regex::new\(\s*[a-z_&]
    message: Regex compiled from variable — may cause ReDoS if input is untrusted
fix: Validate and sanitize regex input, set a size limit, or use regex::RegexBuilder with size_limit()
